{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"19985","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v14273","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"メイザーズ ぬまきち","creatorId":"vndb:s584","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s584","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s584","name":"大沼 明夫","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106127","source":"vndb"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"showerheadz","creatorId":"vndb:s10830","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10830","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10830","name":"林 康","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106130","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"後藤 潤二","creatorId":"vndb:s589","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s589","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s589","name":"後藤 潤二","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106128","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"藍原 京子","creatorId":"vndb:s42493","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s42493","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s42493","name":"藍原 京子","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106129","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"増渕 佳人","creatorId":"vndb:s42494","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s42494","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s42494","name":"増渕 佳人","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106131","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c1596","characterName":"伊藤 誠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"422","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"},{"characterId":"422","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10204"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1596"},"originalCharacterName":"伊藤 誠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1016"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Makoto is the unlucky protagonist of School Days, Summer Days and Shiny Days. (Appears as the main hero in Cross Days.) A generally mannered and composed student in year one of class three, his life becomes complicated when he begins to unfaithfully initiate polyamorous relationships with girls that he is unable or unwilling to singly commit to. Although he is originally casual, gregarious and understanding, after becoming a sex addict, it completely corrupts his personality and he instead became apathetic, rash, and egotistical towards others, regardless of the harm or later consequences. However, once he realizes what he has done wrong, he is quick in his attempts to fix the situation. Makoto lives with his divorced mother and has a younger sister named Itaru who lives with their father. He is childhood friends with Katou Otome and best friends with Sawanaga Taisuke."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1596"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年3組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何に対しても無気力で、めんどうくさがる流されやすい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛に対しては奥手だったが、世界の後押しにより言葉と付き合い始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、いつしか世界へと心が揺れ動いていき・・・。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10204","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『SHINY DAYS』主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりと夏休みを過ごす平凡な青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は別居している妹「いたる」と浜辺で砂遊びや、港で釣り等をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理のレパートリーが豊富で妹の好物であるハンバーグに限らず、魚も捌いたりする等、食育にも気を使っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にでも屈託が無く、優しい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10204","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主角。榊野学园1年3班。双亲离婚，现在和当护士的母亲同住在高级公寓。穿插在世界和言叶2位女主角之间，性格优柔寡断。在单调的日常生活中，对上学时乘坐同一辆电车的女孩产生了淡淡的爱慕之心。不擅长恋爱的他本来觉得只是远远地看着她就够了，但在世界的推动下，那样的日子产生了变化。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"太过没用的个性，加上和玩家选择的选项采取相反的行动这样烦死人的行为，结果诱致悲惨的结局，因此诚与“白色相簿”的藤井冬弥，“愿此刻永恒”的鸣海孝之并列，得到“アダルトゲームにおける最悪のヘタレ主人公(十八禁游戏中最差的愚笨主角)”这样不誉的评价。五大人渣之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓氏来自日本著名政治家，第1、5、7、10任日本首相伊藤博文。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"422"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"167","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1596","value":"167"},{"comparisonValue":"167.5","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"422","value":"167.5cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e953b4ac526ceeb85f18745d9005f54b2b9c69cd4abc29f42c2495f1976a122.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20a6a8fca1cb225fc7d95aa7c0a56c734e507074f9298d1e958ffc577d694607.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c1597","characterName":"西園寺 世界","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"423","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"},{"characterId":"423","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8689"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1597"},"originalCharacterName":"西園寺 世界","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1207"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sekai Saionji is a student in year one of class three who is the antithesis and foil of Kotonoha. A playful and outgoing classmate seated directly next to Makoto, she takes a curious interest in him during their first acquaintance, and in every medium of the series, helps to establish his bond with Kotonoha. Though genuinely upbeat, Sekai does occasionally show a more serious side, and when sufficiently frustrated can be loud, selfish, overemotional and even manipulative. She lives with her mother Youko in the fictional area of Motehara-Sakashita and works part-time as a waitress at the family restaurant Radish."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1597"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園１年３組。天文部。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交的な性格で、親友の清浦刹那と共に過ごすことが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊藤誠と隣の席になり、言葉と誠を付き合わせるようにし向けるも、いつしか誠に惹かれている自分をごまかせなくなってしまい・・・・・・。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8689","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と同じクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの中では明るくムードメーカーで、やや小うるさいとも言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰介が憧れていたように、可愛らしい容姿と明るい性格で、密かにファンは多いが、なんでもあけすけに言う性格で、告白する男の子たちは皆玉砕している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8689","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と同じクラスで、隣りの席の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく人懐こい性格で、クラスのムードメーカー。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8689","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"与母亲同住在家庭公寓。和刹那则是青梅竹马且是异母姐妹。是主要女主角之一。因其明亮的性格所以是气氛制造者。在男性之间拥有极高人气，但拒绝所有人的告白，且十分直截了当。对诚有秘密的感情，为了得到接近诚的借口而和他人调位坐在诚的旁边（原本是刹那的座位）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在诚与言叶交往之前，与诚已亲近到可以直接称呼对方的名字，但诚这时没有把她当作为“一个女孩”。其后自称随意地看到诚手机的待机图片并觉得抱歉，其后安排言叶和诚之间的约会。但是，其原因是为了自己能接近诚，而诚在没有慎重考虑后轻易答应。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当初是在诚的背后作为支援并周旋在诚和言叶之间，而令他们一起共进午餐亦帮助他们发展关系，其后与言叶交谈后知道诚和言叶互相对对方有意思并且言叶已接受了诚的告白，这对世界来说都是预计以外的事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其后为二人理应顺利的发展，世界不断抑制自己的感情，而在帮助诚约会言叶后吻了诚当作对自己的报答，但令这自己一手安排的关系和她本身的处境变得不正常。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于‘Summer Days’中登场，但其处境与本作相反变成坏的，另外成为攻略对象以外的角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓氏来自明治时代政坛元老，第12、14任日本首相西园寺公望"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"155","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1597","value":"155"},{"comparisonValue":"155.3","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"423","value":"155.3cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d0937047625979678e28733242b8ffca3d1f857b9919a1b0fc2b7ffee0a170c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68ded08617b49de4bce9ec800a12726a40ae72913379da734395e4331f3ef64e.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"河原木志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s13","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13","name":"河原木 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:423:4422:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1598","characterName":"桂 言葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"170113"},{"characterId":"424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"},{"characterId":"424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6625"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1598"},"originalCharacterName":"桂 言葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"102"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Polite and reserved, Kotonoha Katsura is a student in year one of class four who is on the student council and serves as one of the most pivotal characters in the story. A cute and noticeably well-endowed bookworm, she becomes the initial love interest of Makoto early into their second term, and with some effort from Sekai Saionji, becomes his girlfriend after she reciprocates her affection for him. While Kotonoha for the most part is calm and gentle, she has a very delicate conscious, which under stress leads to irrational culpability, delusions and even malice. She has a younger sister name Kokoro and lives with their wealthy mother Manami and father in the fictional area of Haramihama. She is disliked by Otome Katou and is subject to her bullying and duress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1598"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年4組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しく、内向的な性格だったが、伊藤誠と付き合うことで、少しずつ変わっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"図書室には、よく通っているため、誠と付き合っているところを目撃した勇気に、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相談を受けることになり、後に勇気の支援も受けて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と付き合い続けるべく奮闘することになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同１年生で、誠や世界と違い、4組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しく引っ込み思案な性格だが、人目を引く容姿（美貌と巨乳）のために、昔から男性恐怖症の気がある。クラスの女子一同から嫌われていて、男子からは距離を置かれて皆牽制しあっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"がっつかず、遠目から見ている誠のことを気にしていたが、介添えのように世界の仲介があり、誠の告白を受け入れる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園１年４組。「桂心」の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーション抜群で、特に胸が大きいが、本人はむしろコンプレックスを感じていて、少しだけ男性が苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"インドア派で夏祭りにはのり気では無かったが、社交的な妹の勧めで参加していく事から彼女の夏休みは加速していく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園 1年生。 桂心の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスのいじめっ子・加藤乙女に、最愛の伊藤誠が助けを求めていると騙されて連れてこられた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"18834","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠の隣のクラスの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通学時の電車が同じで、以前から気になっていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6625","sourceWorkId":"23313","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“我觉得你很幸福，因为你可以选择爱我或不爱我，而我只能选择爱你或更爱你。”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学园1年4班。兴趣是阅读，而由于体质很差不擅长体育。得意作是言叶的母亲（桂真奈美，于『Summer Days』登场）传授的柠檬水。对血腥与恐怖电影有兴趣。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桂言叶有着魔鬼般的身材和天使般的面容，以及和外表完全相反的内向性格。感性意识强烈，容易冲动。虽然已经有了男朋友，却对与男友密切接触有着强烈的抵触情绪。一般恋人之间应有的拥抱、亲吻行为她却完全做不来，性更是她无法逾越的障碍。但是她待人和善，对男友温柔体贴，以及极具东方女性美的外表，树立了她学生版大和抚子的形象，使她深受广大游戏玩家的喜爱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住在豪华的独立房屋的有钱人，双亲都在工作。加上其妹心为4人家庭。是主要女主角之一。老实且畏缩不前的性格、轻度的男性恐惧症。当然，对性与恋爱相关的事相当害怕并陌生，但被同级的其它女子讨厌，受到乙女为首的同学欺负。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"实际上言叶精湛的刀法并不是黑化后精神失常而爆发出来的。之所以可以快狠且准，直击敌人的要害，这跟里其本身的设定有关。桂言叶的里设定之一就是个有武士魂的日本武士，而且也修有居合斩（拔刀术），续作Summer Days有言叶挥刀砍中从高处落下的水滴的片段。和剑道不同的是，剑道是和人拼命击剑，而居合道要的是一击必杀，所以都是瞄准颈动脉这些地方出招。这就是为什么言叶在黑化状态下也能趁其不意夺下世界的刀并瞬间将其秒杀。毕竟贵族家的子女必须会武术才能在将来挑起大梁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随着剧情的发展，各个人物角色都在情感斗争中陷入了不同的道德困境，而唯有桂言叶在形象上一直是未受损的受害者，从未尝试过算计他人；其次，即便是处于黑化失控的情绪下，桂言叶也从不会对心爱的对象（伊藤诚）下毒手；因而受到广大观众的好评，并被其称之为 “女神”、“言叶様”等称号。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在0verflow官方最爱角色排行榜中，言叶以没有悬念的高票数夺得头名，并以接近三倍的高票秒杀了第二位的清浦刹那。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓名来源：第11、13、15任日本首相桂太郎"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"156","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1598","value":"156"},{"comparisonValue":"156.7","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"424","value":"156.7cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8458f58a1282fa61a02441ae7df2d05cc95b600ed6430056ab5ef54ab547f233.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8ab8bb7c5ed8c2005885eca7ac841caca93466cd12d13389eaf89a188d4c634e.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:424:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1599","characterName":"清浦 刹那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"425","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6629"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1599"},"originalCharacterName":"清浦 刹那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"214"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"74"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"142"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Setsuna Kiyoura is a student in year one of class three, who like Kotonoha, is on the student council as a class representative. One of the more inscrutable characters, Setsuna is a keen, focused and habitually tacit girl who tends to have and keep the most level head of her peers when situations go awry. She is Sekai's best friend, having grown up with her, and to a considerable degree is overly solicitous of her, to the point of hurting others to ensure that Sekai is happy. In Summer Days, Setsuna is shy and timid, in contrast to her more serious portrayal in School Days. Her mother, Mai, only makes an appearance in Summer Days. With the exception of Kokoro Katsura, Setsuna is the shortest character of the main cast, and is often mistaken for a junior high school student, a trait she is well aware and conscious of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1599"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年3組。世界の幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"努力家だが、感情を表に出せない性格で、そうした場面を主に世界に頼っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入学当時から伊藤誠に惹かれていて、世界もまた誠を好きであることを知り、世界を応援しようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親しい人間の間では、意外に悪のりをすることもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6629","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙で、表情を変えることが殆どないが、世界とは何も喋らなくても意志疎通ができている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親同士が、昔は親友だったが、今は疎遠。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6629","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"もうひとりの『SHINY DAYS』メインヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“ラディッシュ”での不慣れなアルバイトを頑張っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのとんでもないトラブルが発端となり、やむなく仕方なく「足利いのり」との共同生活に突入する…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はクールで無口な榊野学園１年３組 クラス委員。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6629","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園 1年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼なじみで親友の世界が、同じく幼なじみの二喜にそそのかされて悪いことをさせられそうだと察し、立ち上がった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6629","sourceWorkId":"18834","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学园1年3组。班委员。由于小个子，经常被误会是初中学生。是世界青梅竹马且异母姐妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来是坐在诚的旁边，但在世界的请求下让位。由于了解世界的感觉所以表面上没有什么特别，而实际上却抱着隐藏的感情。正常情况上是支持世界的，但在特定的路径下参与了争夺诚，另外的是有到访海外的经验。拥有自己独立的结局，但在各女角中只有她与光是没有特定的选项存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"收录在光碟里却没有在游戏里使用的资料中，有一段“章鱼吻”的发言，引起了不少Fans的关注。这是游戏里进不去的短剧情，在这段剧情里的对话与后来Summer Days的制作方向竟不谋而合，是否为制作小组蓄意放出的则不得而知了。虽然在本作中有不少优柔寡断的行动，但其唯一有良心的人物设定亦相当受欢迎，在‘Summer Days’中受拔擢成为女主角。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"425"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"bust":[{"comparisonValue":"73","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1599","value":"73"},{"comparisonValue":"74","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"425","value":"74"}],"height":[{"comparisonValue":"142","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1599","value":"142"},{"comparisonValue":"142.5","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"425","value":"142.5cm"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d470fc3defe677c7a9d45041737659e32cc0e192c008e7ebf9b3d75729712a57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc03b324b9e79fbaa074ff121d49926ceb79fbc4e50056fe1b3d115e0e758362.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井本ケイ","creatorId":"vndb:s463","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s463","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s463","name":"井本 ケイ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:425:6911:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1602","characterName":"黒田 光","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"427","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10212"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1602"},"originalCharacterName":"黒田 光","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1109"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"64"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Temperamental and fastidious, Hikari Kuroda is a student in year one of class three, recognizable by her signature squid rings hairstyle. She initially believes that Makoto and Sekai are dating from the very start, and tends to negatively generalize him; later growing closer to him herself. Though she is actually quite friendly and social, Hikari is the most childish of the cast; sporting an unduly knack for whining and prying into the affairs of others. Her family owns a confectionery store and café, famous for its lemon custard pie. Hikari is good friends with Sekai and has an unreciprocated crush on Taisuke Sawanaga."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1602"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年3組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇気と中学時代の同級生で、洋菓子屋の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家の店でバイト（というより、親の手伝い）をしていることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰介のことを密かに想っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10212","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠と同じ3組の女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰介と同じ葵学園出身で、レモンカスタードケーキが有名な市内の洋菓子店の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"密かに泰介のことを好きだが、表には出さずに、泰介をドツキ回している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界と誠が結ばれることを快く思っておらず、誠への風当たりはキツい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10212","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園１年３組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家の洋菓子店を手伝っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「伊藤誠」を毛嫌いしているようだが…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「清浦刹那」がアルバイトをしている事を知り、“ラディッシュ”に遊びに来るようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10212","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学园1年3组。西饼屋的女孩。世界的朋友。深信世界与诚在交往著，但没有认真考虑过言叶与诚距离不断缩短的事实。很喜欢泰介，并根据故事进程与泰介交往。在‘Summer Days’登场。为全部女主角中唯一拥有诚诞下孩子的个别结局。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"427"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/7563c7b740f6b35f3087a9d5e6413e04b59056edc706f7f0d0590d4b4116f1b4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e74d34cd6cddde5c253c09bae9e8ce6237451985000b10ed5142482493b658eb.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:427:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1603","characterName":"加藤 乙女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"428","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"},{"characterId":"428","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10206"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1603"},"originalCharacterName":"加藤 乙女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"401"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Direct and headstrong, Otome Katou is a student in year one of class four, who like Nanami, is a member of the girl's basketball team. She is usually authoritative to her peers, tolerates nothing but her way and opinion, and does not generally associate with anyone but her trio of friends Minami Obuchi, Natsumi Koizumi and Kumi Mori; who together frequently harass and coerce Kotonoha. Despite her difficult behavior and personality however, Otome can be particularly tender and shy, especially around Makoto, who she has known since junior high school and has a crush on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1603"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年4組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子バスケ部に所属し、誠や路夏たちとは同じ学校出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっと前から伊藤誠のことを慕っているが、一向に通じる気配がなく、いつもやきもきしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10206","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"4組の女子をまとめるリーダー格の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誠とは同じ学校で、一緒に遊ぶメンバーの一人だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は思いを寄せていたが、誠が恋愛的な要素に全く鈍いので、想いが通じなかった。前の学校からずっとバスケをしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10206","sourceWorkId":"13913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"野学園１年４組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「伊藤誠」とは中学時代の同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一途な性格で、夏休みの思い出を作りたいと思っているが、妹の「加藤可憐」とは対照的に控えめな態度でなかなか前進出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家の付き合いで夏祭りの準備に忙しい様子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10206","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学园1年4班，与诚是中学时代的友人，与七海同是参加女子篮球社的女孩，也是4班女生中的领头人，欺负言叶的女生圈子里的老大。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"428"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"height":[{"comparisonValue":"164","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1603","value":"164"},{"comparisonValue":"163","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"428","value":"163cm"}],"hip":[{"comparisonValue":"88","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1603","value":"88"},{"comparisonValue":"85","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"428","value":"85"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f200e68c55603983f9e4a7c52d47663683b78671049bae20c92a80aaa8b3cf0d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b809edf319d26a90a9e208e878e32223609915f38f9b3da267f881dcd85c21ab.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩村琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1172","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1172","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1172","name":"岩村 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:428:4813:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1608","characterName":"桂 心","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"3503","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6626"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1608"},"originalCharacterName":"桂 心","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1128"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"122"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kokoro Katsura is the sweet-natured younger sister of Kotonoha. Unlike her older sibling, Kokoro is peppy, talkative and full of curiosity, and although she frequently teases Kotonoha, she worries about her greatly. She has a good friend named Uzuki and affectionately looks up to Makoto as her older brother. Kokoro lives with Kotonoha and their mother Manami and father."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1608"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"言葉の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案な姉の言葉とは違い、好奇心旺盛で快活な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"奥手の言葉をからかったりすることもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6626","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「桂言葉」の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉とは対照的に明るく奔放な性格で、興味があると知らない人にも気軽に話しかける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“ラディッシュ”には毎日のように来る常連客で、勉強をしている事が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"塾のおともだちの影響で、いろんな事に興味津々！"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6626","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"原巳浜商科大学に通う女の子。 桂言葉の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ塾に通う友達の卯月ちゃんから、面白い遊びがあると聞いてやってきた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6626","sourceWorkId":"18834","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"言叶的妹妹。和胆小的姐姐言叶不同，好奇心旺盛，经常捉弄晚熟的姐姐。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3503"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"bust":[{"comparisonValue":"53","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1608","value":"53"},{"comparisonValue":"52","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3503","value":"52"}],"height":[{"comparisonValue":"122","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1608","value":"122"},{"comparisonValue":"119","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3503","value":"119"}],"hip":[{"comparisonValue":"57","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1608","value":"57"},{"comparisonValue":"56","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3503","value":"56"}],"waist":[{"comparisonValue":"47","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1608","value":"47"},{"comparisonValue":"46","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3503","value":"46"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdfb1fc689b4148caad137a2bd5080e018f6db531bbae6e246e02685f04e5c06.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c7a08396c866fdd04a1324517671860d45e87bae7bedc27d4d731928a967a38.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"やなせなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:3503:4714:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7635","characterName":"加藤 可憐","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"110563","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10205"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7635"},"originalCharacterName":"加藤 可憐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"222"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Karen Katou is the playful younger sister of Otome Katou. Unlike her older sibling, Karen is cheerful and unabashed who is just as playfully teasing as she is concerned of Otome. She is good friends with Kazuha and Futaba Nijou and looks up to Makoto as her mentor and role model."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7635"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉である「加藤乙女」の「伊藤誠」に対する中学時代からの秘めた想いを知って応援してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に姉をたてて行動し、ムードメーカー、フォロー役として立ちまわる事が多いが、いざという時には物怖じしない積極性も持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10205","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"加藤乙女的妹妹，正在努力学习考上榊野学园。她贪玩又坚强。与她的姐姐不一样，可怜可以很好地与许多人相处。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110563"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb6586eed64424986648be5a706c84b2d2380a15cc473ba480cc2e7dbe3d1353.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d425a8a2f2c171fa371c47fea157c2853e80dcae37661e33bd92822a171c3d6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中山依里子","creatorId":"vndb:s46185","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s46185","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s46185","name":"中山 依里子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:110563:20943:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7641","characterName":"山県 愛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"110690","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2423"},{"characterId":"110690","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"28630"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10207"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7641"},"originalCharacterName":"山県 愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"614"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"76"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ai Yamagata is a student in year one of class three. She is good friends with Sekai Saionji and Hikari Kuroda, and is an acquaintance of Makoto Ito and Otome Kato from middle school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7641"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園1年3組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"乙女や誠、路夏たちと同じ出身校で、誠や乙女とは一緒のグループとして遊んでいたが、路夏とはあまり面識がなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は、告白に失敗したと思いこんでいる誠に距離を置かれていると同時に、告白に失敗した以上身を引くように乙女に言われており、遠くから誠を見つめている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10207","sourceWorkId":"11694","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"榊野学園１年３組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中学時代にあった「伊藤誠」とのすれ違いを、今も抱えながら友達の関係を続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"NOと言えない性格で状況に流され、順応してしまいがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいで色々と手伝わされることが多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10207","sourceWorkId":"15294","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"山县爱是或Overflow旗下的游戏《Days系列》及其衍生作品的登场角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姓氏和生日来源为日本陆军之父，元帅陆军大将，内阁总理大臣，明治维新元老山县有朋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"山县爱在《Summer Days》、《Cross Days》、《Shiny Days》均有登场，在《School Days》中被提到。她可谓是Cross Days的第二女主角。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱与伊藤诚在同一所初中上学，但她初三才转入。她与诚在初中时相互爱慕，常在海边一起散心。初中毕业时，两人本想相互表白，但同样喜欢诚的加藤乙女在此时挑拨离间，向诚造谣说“爱喜欢诚的好友井伊拓海”，因此诚误以为爱一直亲近他只是为了接近井伊的手段而已，放弃了爱。从此诚一直觉得是爱甩了他。升入高中后，她与诚依然在同一个班，两人关系变得比较尴尬，也较少有交流了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与西园寺世界和加藤乙女一样，爱从很早以前就对诚有意思。然而，她比起那两个人更开放，为了达到自己的目的，她不惜破坏桂言叶和世界与诚的关系，并间接地将足利勇气也拖入麻烦中。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110690"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"waist":[{"comparisonValue":"57","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7641","value":"57"},{"comparisonValue":"54","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110690","value":"54"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3dde25f7ea4c9dac533e944b6f61493d8259e1465552e3ee90df2a2bab426763.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/1418b0fabe748ee4189b438863521613353c94cc589fefb1ecabe20eaf2bd50b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90946:110690:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p4086","sourceCompanyId":"